            Node("raw-cut-18047", "raw_cut_18047", "Original suffix at depth 13, code 284753, node 463110",
                "The statement is EJMOriginalReplayAssembly.Accepted at depth 13, code 284753 and original node 463110. Its checker retains remaining fuel 8, the full prefixCache and full prefixPartial. The proof transports the concrete memoized checker equation through check_eq_original at exactly this fuel, index, cache and partial assignment. Decoder memoization supplies equality; the concrete suffix check remains a separate premise of the transport.", DescribeRole.Theorem),
